---
---
<section
  id="top"
  class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center bg-paper pt-16"
>
  <div class="hero-depth" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">

    <p data-reveal class="font-body text-sm text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-10">
      Product-minded full-stack developer · Manila, PH · Open to remote
    </p>

    <h1
      data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"
      class="font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl font-light text-ink mb-8"
      style="line-height: var(--leading-tight); max-width: 15ch;"
    >
      Six years deciding whether things follow the rules.
    </h1>

    <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="font-body text-lg text-ink-muted mb-6" style="max-width: 54ch; line-height: var(--leading-normal);">
      Healthcare claims, then reviewing developer applications against platform
      policy. Now I build software where the rules are enforced by the database
      instead of a document.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="font-body text-lg text-ink mb-16" style="max-width: 54ch; line-height: var(--leading-normal);">
      Two projects below. One of them you can log into right now.
    </p>

    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3" class="flex items-center gap-8">
      <a
        href="#proof"
        class="font-body text-sm text-accent hover:text-ink transition-colors"
        style="letter-spacing: 0.02em;"
      >
        See the work ↓
      </a>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="font-body text-sm text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors"
        style="letter-spacing: 0.02em;"
      >
        How I got here →
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
